    <briefdescription>
<para>Wave D — CDC High-Cardinality Stress Tests. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Stress coverage for the CDC module hot paths under high-cardinality concurrent load: event stream publishing, concurrent replay, and acknowledgement timeout stress.</para>
<sect1 id="test__cdc__highcardinality__stress_8cpp_1autotoc_md2_1s1"><sect2 id="test__cdc__highcardinality__stress_8cpp_1autotoc_md2">
<title>Test cases</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>HighCardinalityEventStream : concurrent event publishing at scale</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ConcurrentReplayStress : parallel replay requests</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>AcknowledgementTimeoutStress : ack timeout handling under load</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
